==== 原文

My dear Mrs. White,

You promised that you would give us a few days down here during our autumn stay, and we are looking forward to your fulfiling that promise. The weather is perfect at present, and I think you would enjoy our pretty country. Could you manage to come to us on the 1st, and remain till the 7th? You would find the 3.40 train from Paddington a good one. We will send to our station to meet you, of course, and hoping that you will be able to come.

//flushright{
I am, very truly yours.@<br>{}Bella Brown.
//}

P.S.—The Hunt Ball comes off on the 5th, so do not forget to bring a gown that goes well with “pink.”

