#@# [要確認: 原本「hight」「ask ine」は誤植と思はれるが、原本のまま]
Dear Lady Grey,

If any thing could enhance the pleasure of a visit to town in the hight of the season, it would be the enjoyment of your company. It is very kind of you to ask ine, and I am looking forward with keen anticipation to the 16th. The programme you sketch is a very attractive one to a country mouse. I have long been wishing for a ride on a motor, and hear that yours is a most comfortable one. Please tell Sir Archibald that it is most kind of him to include me in his river party. I feel immensely flattered that he should leave the date open on my account.

I shall have to leave quite early on the 24th, as my brother Jim's leave begins on that day, and he will escort me home.

//flushright{
Very sincerely yours.
//}

