==== 原文

Dear Sir,

The bearer of this, Mr. Edward Everett, an esteemed friend of mine, is about to visit Tokyo for the first time, and will consequently be a stranger in your metropolis. Any attentions which you may extend to him will be gratefully appreciated by.

//flushright{
Yours very sincerely@<br>{}…………………
//}

@<ruby>{拜啓, はいけい}、
