私も@<ruby>{感謝, かんしや}の@<ruby>{至, いたり}に@<ruby>{堪, た}へず候。
敬具。

==== 原文

My dear Doctor,

Please allow this to introduce to you Mr. Robert D. Dash of Berlin, Germany. He is making a tour around the world and brought letters to friends of mine in Chicago. Any thing which you can do to aid him to see your city, or any courtesy you can show him will be not only appreciated by him but by myself.

//flushright{
With cordial regards,@<br>{}I am, as ever, Loyally yours.
//}

@<ruby>{斯, かく}の如き紹介狀は、
