==== 原文

Dear Browne,

I shall take it as a great favour if you will do anything you can for my friend Arthur Green, who will present this note to you. He is enthusiastic about art, and no man in London is better qualified to be his cicerone in that matter than yourself, if you can spare him a little of your valuable time. He is a good fellow and will not unduly encroach on it.

//flushright{
Yours Sincerely.
//}

