==== 原文

#@# [要確認: 原本「prosent」は「present」の誤植と思はれるが、原本のまま]
Dear Lady Greene,

Will you allow me to introduce to you my friend Sir Andrew Altschloss, who will prosent this note at your country house next week? He has bought The Windmills, part of which property adjoins yours. I feel certain that you will find him an acquisition and a very good neighbour, and Sir Richard will be interested to hear that he is a thorough sportsman and an enthusiast at golf, while it may commend him to you and Miss Greene to know that he is one of the best waltzers in Vienna. He has always wished to live in England during part of the year, and now the large legacy he has inherited enables him to gratify the wish.

//flushright{
Yours ever Sincerely.
//}

