===== 原文

（1）Mrs. Greene regrets that she is obliged to postpone the dinner party arranged for Thursday, owing to the sudden illness of her son. She hopes Mrs. Browne will accept her apologies.
（2）Mrs. Greene regrets very much that owing to Mr. Greene having met with an accident she is obliged to postpone till Thursday the 23rd the dinner party arranged for the 16th. She hopes Mrs. Browne is disengaged for that evening and begs her to accept Mrs. Greene's sincere apologies.

（3）Mrs. Browne regrets extremely to hear of the illness of young Mr. Greene and sincerely trusts that it may prove to be nothing of a serious character.

（4）Mrs. Browne is extremely sorry that Mr. Greene has met with an accident and hopes that the effect will soon pass. She has no engagement for Thursday the 23rd and accepts with pleasure Mrs. Greene's invitation for that evening.

