==== 原文

//flushright{
Honolulu, Hawaii.
//}

Dear Mrs. Dash,

Thank you so much for coming to see me off that last day, and for the beautiful flowers which lasted some days on the steamer. We had a smooth voyage as far as Hawaii, and now we rest here for two weeks enjoying the tropical climate and warm air of the islands. I am feeling better already, and hope to become strong again soon. Please remember me to Dr. Dash and all the friends of our different societies.

Hoping you, too, are stronger, and with kindest regards,

//flushright{
I am yours sincerely.
//}

