#@# [要確認: 原本「ynthe future」は「in the future」の誤植、句點なしの「America I shall」も原本のまま]
To the Ladies of the Shitsumonkai,

I wish to put on record in a letter to you my sincere thanks for the beautiful dinner which you so kindly gave me on October 2nd, at the Seiyōken. Your kindness to me during my stay in Japan has been unfailing, and I leave you with great regret, hoping however that I may return again. I wish for you all the best blessings of life and that ynthe future as in the past you may be successful in your pursuit of knowledge and in my home in America I shall often have you in mind. Again thanking you,

//flushright{
I am very truly@<br>{}Ellen B. Buck.
//}

