　　　@<ruby>{愛, いとほ}しき@<ruby>{某, ぼう}@<ruby>{夫人, ふじん}

==== 原文

#@# [要確認: 原本「soon he quite well」は「be」の誤植と思はれるが、原本のまま]
My dear Mrs. Dash,

I am leaving a very small remembrance for you for Christmas but a great deal of love goes with it. The little cross we bought in Bethlehem where Christ was born and Mr. Ladd sends it with best Christmas wishes and we wish you all a very happy New Year. I was very sorry indeed not to have seen you at Countess——'s. I hope you are not really worse and that you will very soon he quite well. I am ashamed not to have been to enquire for you, but with Christmas work and so many engagements it has been impossible.

With love to you and kindest regards to Dr. Dash,

//flushright{
Affectionately yours@<br>{}Frances S. Ladd.
//}
